title: Start
---
Villager: I am busy right now. Talk to the right worker if you need help.
===

title: Lumber
---
Lumber: Looking for something? I can craft more than boards and handles.
Lumber: I have the parts for a strong Spyglass, but I will not give it away for free.
Lumber: Bring me 60 Wood, 25 Stick, 12 iron, and 4 flaming_ore. I will craft the Spyglass for you.
-> Trade the materials for the Spyglass <<if has_items("Wood:60|Stick:25|iron:12|flaming_ore:4")>>
    <<trade_items "Wood:60|Stick:25|iron:12|flaming_ore:4" "Spyglass" 1>>
    Lumber: Good. Take the Spyglass. It should survive rough weather if you treat it carefully.
-> What is special about that Spyglass?
    Lumber: The reinforced frame keeps the lens steady in storms and heavy fog.
-> What will you give me?
    Lumber: A reinforced Spyglass. Bring the materials and I will craft it for you.
-> I will come back.
    Lumber: Come back with 60 Wood, 25 Stick, 12 iron, and 4 flaming_ore.
===

title: Miner
---
Miner: You need something forged? I can make an Anchor stronger than anything sold in the village.
Miner: It will not be cheap. Common iron would snap under the weight.
Miner: Bring me 15 diamond, 10 radium, 6 plasma, and 10 gold. Then I will forge the Anchor for you.
-> Trade the ore for the Anchor <<if has_items("diamond:15|radium:10|plasma:6|gold:10")>>
    <<trade_items "diamond:15|radium:10|plasma:6|gold:10" "Anchor" 1>>
    Miner: Done. Take the Anchor. It will hold against almost anything.
-> Why those materials?
    Miner: Diamond takes the pressure, gold carries the rune lines, radium hardens the metal, and plasma binds it together.
-> What will you give me?
    Miner: A reinforced Anchor. Bring the ore and I will forge it for you.
-> I will come back.
    Miner: Bring 15 diamond, 10 radium, 6 plasma, and 10 gold.
===

title: Sailor
---
Sailor: You want my help getting off this island? I would leave if my boat were ready.
Sailor: The old Spyglass is cracked, and the Anchor will not survive another crossing.
Sailor: Bring me a sturdy Spyglass and a reinforced Anchor. Then I will help you get out of here.
-> Hand over the Spyglass and Anchor <<if has_items("Spyglass:1|Anchor:1")>>
    <<trade_items "Spyglass:1|Anchor:1" "SailBoat" 1>>
    <<complete_game>>
    Sailor: These will work. The boat is ready. I will help you leave the island.
-> Why do you need both?
    Sailor: The Spyglass finds a safe line through the fog. The Anchor keeps the boat from being dragged into the rocks.
-> I have work to do.
    Sailor: Find a sturdy Spyglass and a reinforced Anchor. Come back when you have both.
===

title: Fisherman
---
<<jump Sailor>>
